    <p><strong>ProBrothers Construction remodels kitchens in <a href="/locations/media/">Media, PA</a> and across Delaware County</strong> &mdash; custom cabinets, countertops, islands, tile backsplash, flooring, and full layout redesign. 15+ years, 5.0 rating, 135+ completed projects. Licensed and insured in Pennsylvania. Free quote within one business day.</p>
  </aside>

  <!-- ===== What Is Kitchen Remodeling ===== -->
  <section class="section svc-overview" id="what-is-kitchen-remodeling" aria-label="What Is Kitchen Remodeling">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="svc-overview__grid">
        <div class="svc-overview__content reveal" data-reveal="left">
          <span class="section__kicker">SERVICE OVERVIEW</span>
          <h2 class="section__title">
            Kitchen Remodeling in Media, PA
            <svg class="blueprint" viewBox="0 0 160 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
