              <circle cx="8" cy="12" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
              <circle cx="152" cy="13" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
            </svg>
          </h2>
          <p class="svc-overview__para">A kitchen remodel updates or completely rebuilds the kitchen — from a targeted cabinet-and-countertop refresh to a full gut renovation that reconfigures the layout, plumbing, and electrical. In Delaware County, PA, kitchen remodels typically range from <strong>$20,000 to $80,000</strong> depending on scope, materials, and kitchen size. ProBrothers Construction has delivered kitchen remodels across <a href="/locations/media/">Media</a>, <a href="/locations/west-chester/">West Chester</a>, Newtown Square, <a href="/locations/king-of-prussia/">King of Prussia</a>, and the broader Main Line since 2009.</p>
          <p class="svc-overview__para">Our team manages every stage in-house — demolition, framing, electrical coordination, plumbing, cabinetry, countertops, tile, and trim. We provide written project schedules and weekly progress updates throughout the job.</p>
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--accent btn--lg" data-magnetic>Request a Free Quote</a>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-overview__media reveal" data-reveal="right">
