          <p>The backbone of every kitchen remodel is the cabinetry. ProBrothers designs and builds <a href="/services/cabinets/">custom kitchen cabinets</a> in solid wood, plywood, or MDF — fully sized and configured to your kitchen's exact dimensions. We offer painted, stained, and glazed finishes, soft-close hinges and drawer glides, pull-out shelving, lazy Susans, and custom pantry solutions.</p>
          <p>For homeowners in Delaware County who want semi-custom options, we also source and install premium cabinet lines with shorter lead times. Every cabinet installation includes a free in-home design consultation so you can visualize layout, door style, and hardware before any work begins.</p>
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--accent btn--lg" style="margin-top:1rem;display:inline-block" data-magnetic>Get a Free Cabinet Consultation</a>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="svc-testimonial reveal" data-reveal="right">
          <div class="review__stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
          <p>&ldquo;The kitchen cabinets ProBrothers built for us are absolutely stunning. Custom-sized to every inch of the space, soft-close everything, and the paint finish is flawless. They finished on schedule and the crew was professional throughout.&rdquo;</p>
          <footer>Michael R., West Chester, PA</footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Countertops & Backsplash ===== -->
