            <path d="M0,12 C40,4 80,20 120,10 L160,14" stroke-width="2.5" style="--len:220"/>
            <circle cx="8" cy="12" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
            <circle cx="152" cy="13" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
          </svg>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-prose reveal">
        <p>ProBrothers installs quartz, granite, quartzite, marble, porcelain, and butcher block countertops — templated to fit your kitchen and edge-profiled to your specification. We work with local Delaware County stone fabricators to keep lead times short and quality control tight.</p>
        <p>Tile backsplash installation is a ProBrothers specialty. Subway tile, herringbone mosaic, Zellige handmade tile, large-format porcelain slab backsplash — our tile setters handle the full scope from layout planning to grouting and sealing. Backsplash upgrades typically cost $1,500&ndash;$5,000 for a standard kitchen in <a href="/locations/media/">Media, PA</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Kitchen Islands & Layout Redesign ===== -->
