        <p>For homeowners looking to open up their kitchen or change the flow, we handle layout redesigns that may involve removing non-load-bearing walls, relocating the sink or range, or expanding into an adjacent dining area. All layout changes in <a href="/locations/media/">Media, PA</a> and Delaware County are permitted and inspected per local code. This type of work often overlaps with our <a href="/services/remodeling/">full home remodeling</a> scope.</p>
