        <p>We also coordinate appliance selection and installation, ensuring your new cabinet layout integrates seamlessly with your refrigerator, range, dishwasher, and microwave dimensions. For premium kitchen remodels ($60,000+), we project-manage the full scope including appliance delivery and final commissioning.</p>
      </div>
